{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>前港姐黃心穎與RubberBand鼓手泥鯭（黎萬宏）不知不覺已攜手走過3個年頭。婚後生活一直過得低調踏實且不時放閃，適逢兩人結婚3周年紀念日，黃心穎在IG上載多張相片大方放閃，記錄兩人的平淡日常。</p><figure><img alt=\"黃心穎與泥鯭不知不覺已攜手走過3個年頭。(IG圖片)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240213/834018306749894656278604.jpeg/ho_hqOq4mem_MXEXTJVFJw4LFPR8jp36vw6Q3L8OkNw\"/><figcaption>黃心穎與泥鯭不知不覺已攜手走過3個年頭。(IG圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>披皮褸慶皮革婚甜蜜放閃</p><p>西方傳統習俗將結婚3週年稱為「皮革婚」（Leather Anniversary）。相片中黃心穎特意披上型格黑色皮褸應節，雙手捧著老公泥鯭所送的一大束玫瑰花，對著鏡頭展露燦爛笑容；泥鯭則以灰色T恤便服示人，親自掌鏡與太太貼頭自拍，恩愛之情溢於言表。</p><figure><img alt=\"黃心穎泥鯭慶祝結婚3週年。（IG@jacquelinebwong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261028/1192164741913907200604293.jpeg/J2AzKDyJDUamXmGW8wl_V66iM6AbKgYE9gA-nfYAPp0\"/><figcaption>黃心穎泥鯭慶祝結婚3週年。（IG@jacquelinebwong）</figcaption></figure><p>留家打邊爐青菜當收花超貼地</p><p>兩公婆亦沒有大費周章出外吃燭光晚餐，反而選擇回歸平淡留在家中簡單打邊爐度過。只見她搞笑地將一盆青菜當作花束捧在手上，並幽默寫上「Bouquet #2」，更附上一家四口（兩夫妻加兩隻愛犬）的表情符號，甜蜜又貼地。黃心穎亦特別曬出家中毛孩的近照，相中只見她伸手與兩隻乖巧坐在地板上的愛犬互動，畫面非常溫馨。黃心穎在帖文中寫道：「It's interesting to learn what each new anniversary is called. And here we are, happy \"leather\" anniversary.」一家四口的生活幸福滿瀉。</p><figure><img alt=\"簡簡單單度過。（IG@jacquelinebwong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261028/1192164739548188672504832.jpeg/9nZqM_odWkRZ3ivkYly8fsCxvpA_a3Ql5AXSHeQF0h0\"/><figcaption>簡簡單單度過。（IG@jacquelinebwong）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一盆青菜當第二束花。（IG@jacquelinebwong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261028/1192164737257967616430259.jpeg/vc8gLYHv3pY5H6FdD03vkmblQgYBgoUmzeLgYM3i4GA\"/><figcaption>一盆青菜當第二束花。（IG@jacquelinebwong）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一家4口。（IG@jacquelinebwong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261028/1192164735030661120740986.jpeg/r-PiL6PXFf5sCoTZQ5aKbpgYa3wo4JQ7CyRInAskSJw\"/><figcaption>一家4口。（IG@jacquelinebwong）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T12:41:21.053907+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":678,"images":5,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T12:20:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T13:18:40.818531+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T12:38:39.044158+00:00","content_hash":"b46f46cfa8b03dff681a4c6d4875d9f67f453a77d4ed95aabaecd4a4517c834f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}